  "notes": "IGdm, an Electron/browser desktop client for Instagram DMs styled with Bootstrap defaults. Group chats show 3-5 round illustrated avatars side by side. Unread rows get a blue snippet color (#168bf9) and a blue dot that overlaps the relative timestamp (layout bug). Received bubbles are near-white with thin borders, tiny 10px sender name above and timestamp bottom-right ('11:40 - Nov 18'); sent bubbles are saturated blue with white text, right-aligned, rounded 8px. Top bar has a subtle white-to-light-gray gradient. Composer is a borderless textarea with line paperclip and smiley icons."
